{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202610310508093875108338268d9d6WhrtCgnp","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_e541f0f2afcc4c0daa1d622ebc6eb8ae","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"(async () => {\n  // Let's get information about specific pages, starting with 00 · Start Here 设计任务 (0:1)\n  const page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(\"0:1\");\n  const data = [];\n  function traverse(node, depth = 0) {\n    if (depth > 4) return;\n    const item = { type: node.type, id: node.id, name: node.name };\n    if (node.type === 'TEXT') {\n      item.characters = node.characters;\n    }\n    data.push(item);\n    if ('children' in node) {\n      for (const child of node.children) {\n        traverse(child, depth + 1);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  traverse(page);\n  return data.slice(0, 100);\n})();","description":"Get first 100 elements of Page 0:1 to understand the task brief.","fileKey":"uCZr4bpGdqwWmB3Jcmxt24"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10908,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9c1f8acf-be29-4219-bdd6-9b68d216abf9","uuid":"450a55d6-33c6-4f37-8f05-7c8bc4d0d60a","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:08:44.560Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_e541f0f2afcc4c0daa1d622ebc6eb8ae","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_e541f0f2afcc4c0daa1d622ebc6eb8ae","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[{\"type\":\"PAGE\",\"id\":\"0:1\",\"name\":\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:2\",\"name\":\"Start Here · Brief\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:3\",\"name\":\"Header\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:4\",\"name\":\"NECTAR · LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\",\"characters\":\"NECTAR · LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:5\",\"name\":\"Nectar — online groceries app\",\"characters\":\"Nectar — online groceries app\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:6\",\"name\":\"Design the complete Nectar mobile grocery app: a shopper in Dhaka signs in with a phone number, browses the store, opens a product, explores a category, fills the cart, checks out, gets an order confirmation and manages the account. Canvas 414 × 896 (iPhone), light mode only. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\",\"characters\":\"Design the complete Nectar mobile grocery app: a shopper in Dhaka signs in with a phone number, browses the store, opens a product, explores a category, fills the cart, checks out, gets an order confirmation and manages the account.\\nCanvas 414 × 896 (iPhone), light mode only. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:7\",\"name\":\"How to work\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:8\",\"name\":\"How to work\",\"characters\":\"How to work\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:9\",\"name\":\"1. Build exactly the 12 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / warning / disabled, rating), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the main navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use product photos, category images, the logo, flag, illustrations and icons from 04 · Media. People have no photos: use Avatar_Neutral. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\",\"characters\":\"1. Build exactly the 12 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links.\\n2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions.\\n3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / warning / disabled, rating), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently.\\n4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the main navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file.\\n5. Use product photos, category images, the logo, flag, illustrations and icons from 04 · Media. People have no photos: use Avatar_Neutral.\\n6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:10\",\"name\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:11\",\"name\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\",\"characters\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:12\",\"name\":\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\",\"characters\":\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:13\",\"name\":\"Frame cards\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:14\",\"name\":\"01_Splash\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:21\",\"name\":\"02_Onboarding\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:28\",\"name\":\"03_Sign_In\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:35\",\"name\":\"04_Verification\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:42\",\"name\":\"05_Home\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:49\",\"name\":\"06_Product_Detail\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:56\",\"name\":\"07_Explore\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:63\",\"name\":\"08_Beverages\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:70\",\"name\":\"09_My_Cart\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:77\",\"name\":\"10_Checkout_Overlay\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:84\",\"name\":\"11_Order_Accepted\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:91\",\"name\":\"12_Account\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:98\",\"name\":\"Navigation structure\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:99\",\"name\":\"Navigation structure\",\"characters\":\"Navigation structure\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:100\",\"name\":\"• Onboarding: 01_Splash → 02_Onboarding → 03_Sign_In → 04_Verification → 05_Home. • Main navigation on 05, 07, 09, 12 — five tabs in this order: Shop (Icon_Shop) → 05 · Explore (Icon_Explore) → 07 · Cart (Icon_Cart) → 09 · Favourite (Icon_Favourite, entry only) · Account (Icon_Account) → 12. The current tab must match the frame. How it looks is yours. • Pushed screens with back: 04, 06, 08. 06 and 08 have no main navigation. • 10_Checkout_Overlay opens over 09_My_Cart; 11_Order_Accepted replaces it. • Entry only (no screen required): See all, add to cart on product cards, share, favourite, filter, Resend Code, social sign-in, Track Order, Favourite tab, Delivery / Payment / Promo Code rows, account entries, edit name, Log Out. • There is no search-results, filter, favourites, location or order-failed screen — do not add frames beyond the 12.\",\"characters\":\"• Onboarding: 01_Splash → 02_Onboarding → 03_Sign_In → 04_Verification → 05_Home.\\n• Main navigation on 05, 07, 09, 12 — five tabs in this order: Shop (Icon_Shop) → 05 · Explore (Icon_Explore) → 07 · Cart (Icon_Cart) → 09 · Favourite (Icon_Favourite, entry only) · Account (Icon_Account) → 12. The current tab must match the frame. How it looks is yours.\\n• Pushed screens with back: 04, 06, 08. 06 and 08 have no main navigation.\\n• 10_Checkout_Overlay opens over 09_My_Cart; 11_Order_Accepted replaces it.\\n• Entry only (no screen required): See all, add to cart on product cards, share, favourite, filter, Resend Code, social sign-in, Track Order, Favourite tab, Delivery / Payment / Promo Code rows, account entries, edit name, Log Out.\\n• There is no search-results, filter, favourites, location or order-failed screen — do not add frames beyond the 12.\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:101\",\"name\":\"Fixed data & copy\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:102\",\"name\":\"Fixed data & copy\",\"characters\":\"Fixed data & copy\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:103\",\"name\":\"Use these values verbatim.\",\"characters\":\"Use these values verbatim.\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:104\",\"name\":\"Data cards\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:105\",\"name\":\"Shopper\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:108\",\"name\":\"Catalog (name · unit · price · image)\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:111\",\"name\":\"Beverages (name · size · price)\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:114\",\"name\":\"Home\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:117\",\"name\":\"Product detail\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:120\",\"name\":\"Cart & checkout\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:123\",\"name\":\"Explore\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:126\",\"name\":\"Sign in, verification & order\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:129\",\"name\":\"Account\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:132\",\"name\":\"Source corrections\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:135\",\"name\":\"What is fixed · what is yours\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:136\",\"name\":\"What is fixed · what is yours\",\"characters\":\"What is fixed · what is yours\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:137\",\"name\":\"Fixed vs yours\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:138\",\"name\":\"Fixed (given)\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:141\",\"name\":\"Yours (designer decides)\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:144\",\"name\":\"How it is evaluated\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:145\",\"name\":\"How it is evaluated\",\"characters\":\"How it is evaluated\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:146\",\"name\":\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\",\"characters\":\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:147\",\"name\":\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data & copy accuracy 3. Flow & prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality & consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current tabs, quantities, favourite, empty code input, checkout over cart)\",\"characters\":\"1. Checklist coverage per frame\\n2. Data & copy accuracy\\n3. Flow & prototype completeness\\n4. Information hierarchy\\n5. Visual quality & consistency of your own system\\n6. Component reuse\\n7. State design (current tabs, quantities, favourite, empty code input, checkout over cart)\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:148\",\"name\":\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 12 named frames, your components and the prototype.\",\"characters\":\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 12 named frames, your components and the prototype.\"}]"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9c1f8acf-be29-4219-bdd6-9b68d216abf9","uuid":"ac6bc031-9d9a-471f-bcf1-c45c920a20e0","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:08:48.321Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"[{\"type\":\"PAGE\",\"id\":\"0:1\",\"name\":\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:2\",\"name\":\"Start Here · Brief\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:3\",\"name\":\"Header\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:4\",\"name\":\"NECTAR · LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\",\"characters\":\"NECTAR · LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:5\",\"name\":\"Nectar — online groceries app\",\"characters\":\"Nectar — online groceries app\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:6\",\"name\":\"Design the complete Nectar mobile grocery app: a shopper in Dhaka signs in with a phone number, browses the store, opens a product, explores a category, fills the cart, checks out, gets an order confirmation and manages the account. Canvas 414 × 896 (iPhone), light mode only. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\",\"characters\":\"Design the complete Nectar mobile grocery app: a shopper in Dhaka signs in with a phone number, browses the store, opens a product, explores a category, fills the cart, checks out, gets an order confirmation and manages the account.\\nCanvas 414 × 896 (iPhone), light mode only. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\"},{\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"id\":\"5:7\",\"name\":\"How to work\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:8\",\"name\":\"How to work\",\"characters\":\"How to work\"},{\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"id\":\"5:9\",\"name\":\"1. Build exactly the 12 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The l